      "text": "I recommend the January 8 Turkish Airlines business-class award via LAX and Istanbul that arrives in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. January 10. Among the shown choices, it has the earliest arrival and shortest elapsed journey, but it requires a separately booked SFO–LAX flight, and award seats, taxes, and support for the requested traveler are unverified.",
